  unitName: Fire Samba Ramna
  unitId: 10365
  unitNumber: 502
  description: A former Guardian who attempted to stop the gods' plan to destroy
    the humans. Leaving the land of the gods as a traitor, her lover, now her enemy,
    appeared before her. Clashing swords with a man who now saw her as a traitor,
    she risked her life trying to persuade him to change. There is no record depicting
    how the volcanic clashing of these star-crossed lovers ended. However, a recently
    discovered diary suggests that they may have possibly made up in the end.
  summonDesc: I'll show you my secret fire dance!<br>No one can stop me now!<br>Alright
    then, here I go!
  fusionDesc: I like strong people,<br>but what is left for someone who's<br>surpassed
    everyone before them?
  evoDesc: Do you believe in the <br>power of the love like I do?<br>Look how strong
    it's made me!
  element: 1
  rarity: 5
